Package: neatdm
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libsqlite3-0, libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.4), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.4), libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.4), libqt6network6 (>= 6.4)
Maintainer: NeatDM-Linux project
Description: Download manager with browser-extension integration
 Open-source, protocol-compatible Linux reimplementation of NeatDownloadManager:
 segmented multi-connection engine, resume, bandwidth limits, HTTP(S) proxy and
 SOCKS support, Basic/Digest auth, HLS downloads and native wake-up from the
 official browser extension (WebSocket 127.0.0.1:10007).
